FAIL  mallory can still read db.env (mode 644) — a secret should be 600
FAIL  mallory can still get into private (mode 755) — take everything away from others

RESULT: FAIL (4 check(s) failed)
[exit 1]

# solution.md
$ cd /work/app && find . -type f -perm -o=w | sort > /work/writable.txt && chmod 755 run.sh && chmod 644 index.php img/logo.png

[exit 0]

